        "Authored the AvalonEdit integration and theming strategy in .squad/decisions.md covering editor host replacement (AvalonEdit TextEditor behind an IRegionCodeEditor seam replacing the BlockUIContainer-hosted TextBox), input re-mapping (native caret/mouse selection preserving the 811809a0 bubbling handledEventsToo fix and ShouldClaimRegionMouseGesture, fenced Ctrl\u002BC/Ctrl\u002BX, and EmbeddedCaretNavMath-driven Up/Down boundary-exit onto TextArea/Caret/Document), and an imperative per-editor HighlightingColor palette push.",
        "Specified the ICSharpCode.AvalonEdit package addition as a Step 2 (migration) action rather than performing it in this architecture task.",
