      "taskId": "AVALONEDIT-20261014-003",
      "title": "Add clickable language picker popup",
      "description": "Stage 2. Turn the static language label (currently the \u0022Auto Detect -- Plain Text\u0022 TextBlock) into a clickable trigger that opens a WPF Popup positioned directly below the label.\n\n## Observable outcome\n\nClicking the label opens a Popup listing, in order, Auto detect, Plain text, then every supported grammar. Selecting an item updates the region\u0027s mode and visible label and writes through to the fence tag using the serialization convention from task 002 (explicit language token, bare fence for Auto detect, reserved text token for Plain text). The selected mode persists across serialization round-trips and sets the mode later highlighting stages consume. No syntax colors are required to prove the picker.\n\n## Consumers\n\nTask 004\u0027s highlighting and auto-detect logic consume the selected mode via the picker-mode output; task 008 adds headless coverage of the write-through and persistence.",
      "dependsOn": [
        "AVALONEDIT-20261014-002"
      ],
