      "verificationLevel": "enhanced"
    },
    {
      "taskId": "AVALONEDIT-20261014-005",
      "title": "Bundle custom grammars: JSON, TypeScript, YAML, SQL",
      "description": "Stage 4. Add and bundle custom AvalonEdit .xshd highlighting grammars for JSON, TypeScript, YAML, and SQL, registered with the picker list, the highlighting engine, and the light/dark palette hook from task 004.\n\n## Observable outcome\n\nEach of JSON, TypeScript, YAML, and SQL appears in the language picker and, when selected or auto-detected, renders its own syntax highlighting with correct light and dark colors in a region. The grammars load from embedded resources without runtime exceptions.\n\n## Consumers\n\nThe production region editor and picker consume the four new grammars through the existing engine and hook. The following human validation gate uses copy-ready sample snippets to confirm per-language color correctness and allows iterative palette tuning.",
      "dependsOn": [
        "AVALONEDIT-20261014-004"
      ],
      "priority": "mid",
      "status": "pending",
      "agentAssignments": [
        {
          "agentHandle": "lyra-morn",
          "role": "Add and register the JSON, TypeScript, YAML, and SQL .xshd grammars",
          "allowGenericChildren": true
        }
      ],
      "agentRoutingMode": "assigned",
      "outputs": [
